INDEPENDENT COMPONENTS
----------------------
This project is distributed together with one independent open-source
component, which remains under its own licence and copyright. It is NOT
licensed under our MIT licence, and nothing in LICENSE grants any right
over it:

  Harmony ............... MIT              (c) 2017 Andreas Pardeike

Harmony is what makes a mod possible for a game with no official modding API.
It rewrites methods in memory at runtime; it changes no file on disk and
touches nothing in your TerraTech installation.

The Archipelago protocol and its Python client library are by the Archipelago
project, MIT licensed. This world plugs into Archipelago; it does not include
or modify it.


THE BLOCK TABLE
---------------
The list of block names this world shuffles is read from your own installed
copy of TerraTech, on your machine, by a tool in this repository. The names
are facts about the game, not content copied from it -- no block data, model,
texture or string belonging to Payload Studios is stored here.
